  unitName: Fire God Lava
  unitId: 10124
  unitNumber: 155
  description: An elite swordswoman from a top-secret project in the ruined Agni
    Empire. Through many duels her strength is said to have reached that of a fire
    god. She used her strength well during the war with the gods and received massive
    support from those who needed her to defend the empire. However, rumor has it
    that she wanted a rematch with Vargas even more than a battle with the gods.
  summonDesc: Make me your ally,<br>and I will show you a fire<br>which burns all
    in its way.
  fusionDesc: The inferno fuels my strength.<br>Burning souls, come to me!
  evoDesc: God or human,<br>I care not what form<br>my foe takes!
